// SR 651.1 — Chapter 4a Transparency of Legal Entities based abroad with De Facto Management in Switzerland
// generated by src/parse.py. Do not edit by hand.

:NOTE
Inserted by No I 3 of the FA of 21 June 2019 on the Implementation of the Recommendations of the Global Forum on Transparency and the Exchange of Information for Tax Purposes, in force since 1 Nov. 2019 (AS 2019 3161; BBl 2019 279).
|

:NOTE
English is not an official language of the Swiss Confederation. This translation is provided for information purposes only and has no legal force.

:INFO
Art. 22ibis
If a legal entity that is based abroad is in fact managed in Switzerland, it must keep a register of its proprietors at its actual place of management. The register must record the first name and surname or company name and the address of these persons.

